prose-authenticity plugin

This plugin is a port of the `prose-authenticity` plugin, version 0.5.0, in a
private repository of ai-advanced-futures. Luis F. Amadeo wrote it. It is under
the MIT license. This plugin takes its agents, library scripts, configuration,
and tests from it, with these changes:

  - The contract with the host system of the source repository is removed. No
    agent has a mode that skips a question, and no agent asks the person a
    question.
  - The commands run in the main conversation. They dispatch the agents with
    the Agent tool and full agent names. The setup steps are in the setup
    command.
  - The skills have a bare name that is the name of the folder.
  - The library scripts run with `uv run ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/lib/<file>.py`,
    and each script has a PEP 723 header.
  - `lib/fact_gate.py` stops when the handoff file of grounded-synthesis has the
    status failed. `lib/extract_prose.py` has the option `--out`, and
    `lib/hf_detectors.py` prints its availability when it runs as a script.
  - The tests, the fixtures, and the documents are written again for this
    repository.

